[{"lesson_id":21, "module_id":10, "course_id":5, "title":"Zero Conditional", "description":"Gi\u1edbi thi\u1ec7u c\u00e2u \u0111i\u1ec1u ki\u1ec7n lo\u1ea1i 0 \u2013 d\u00f9ng \u0111\u1ec3 n\u00f3i v\u1ec1 s\u1ef1 th\u1eadt hi\u1ec3n nhi\u00ean, quy lu\u1eadt v\u00e0 th\u00f3i quen.", "content":"\ud83d\udd39 C\u1ea5u tr\u00fac: If + Present Simple, Present Simple\n\nV\u00ed d\u1ee5:\n\n- If you heat water to 100\u00b0C, it boils.\n\n- If people don\u2019t sleep enough, they get tired.\n\n- If it rains, the ground gets wet.\n\n\n\ud83d\udcdd Ghi nh\u1edb:\nD\u00f9ng Zero Conditional cho nh\u1eefng \u0111i\u1ec1u lu\u00f4n \u0111\u00fang ho\u1eb7c l\u1eb7p \u0111i l\u1eb7p l\u1ea1i.", "video_url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/my-course-videos/The%20first%20conditional%20-%20Grammar-%20Conditionals%20with%20Georgie%20-%20YouTube.mp4", "video_duration":"08:12", "exercise_type":"", "exercise_data":, "exercise_duration":0, "pass_score":0, "max_score":0, "file_attachment":"", "sort_order":1, "lesson_type":"video", "has_exercise":0, "is_free":1, "is_active":1, "view_count":0, "created_at":"2025-11-14 23:00:45", "updated_at":"2025-11-21 15:07:54"},
 {"lesson_id":22, "module_id":10, "course_id":5, "title":"First Conditional", "description":"C\u00e2u \u0111i\u1ec1u ki\u1ec7n lo\u1ea1i 1 m\u00f4 t\u1ea3 t\u00ecnh hu\u1ed1ng c\u00f3 kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng x\u1ea3y ra trong t\u01b0\u01a1ng lai.", "content":"\ud83d\udd39 C\u1ea5u tr\u00fac: If + Present Simple, WILL + V\n\nV\u00ed d\u1ee5:\n\n- If you study hard, you will pass the exam.\n\n- If it rains tomorrow, we will stay home.\n\n- If she calls me, I will tell her the news.\n\n\n\ud83c\udfaf L\u01b0u \u00fd:\nFirst Conditional lu\u00f4n n\u00f3i v\u1ec1 **kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng th\u1eadt**, kh\u00f4ng ph\u1ea3i gi\u1ea3 \u0111\u1ecbnh.", "video_url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/my-course-videos/The%20first%20conditional%20-%20Grammar-%20Conditionals%20with%20Georgie%20-%20YouTube.mp4", "video_duration":"07:45", "exercise_type":"", "exercise_data":, "exercise_duration":0, "pass_score":0, "max_score":0, "file_attachment":"", "sort_order":2, "lesson_type":"video", "has_exercise":0, "is_free":0, "is_active":1, "view_count":0, "created_at":"2025-11-14 23:00:45", "updated_at":"2025-11-21 18:18:28"},
 {"lesson_id":23, "module_id":10, "course_id":5, "title":"Second Conditional", "description":"C\u00e2u \u0111i\u1ec1u ki\u1ec7n lo\u1ea1i 2 \u2013 d\u00f9ng cho gi\u1ea3 \u0111\u1ecbnh kh\u00f4ng c\u00f3 th\u1eadt \u1edf hi\u1ec7n t\u1ea1i.", "content":"\ud83d\udd39 C\u1ea5u tr\u00fac: If + Past Simple, WOULD + V\n\nV\u00ed d\u1ee5:\n\n- If I had a million dollars, I would travel around the world.\n\n- If she were taller, she would play basketball.\n\n- If they lived closer, we would meet more often.\n\n\n\ud83d\udca1 Tip:\nTrong c\u00e2u \u0111i\u1ec1u ki\u1ec7n lo\u1ea1i 2, \u201cwere\u201d \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c d\u00f9ng cho m\u1ecdi ch\u1ee7 ng\u1eef.", "video_url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/my-course-videos/The%20second%20conditional%20-%20Grammar-%20Conditionals%20with%20Georgie%20-%20YouTube.mp4", "video_duration":"09:10", "exercise_type":"", "exercise_data":, "exercise_duration":0, "pass_score":0, "max_score":0, "file_attachment":"", "sort_order":3, "lesson_type":"video", "has_exercise":0, "is_free":0, "is_active":1, "view_count":0, "created_at":"2025-11-14 23:00:45", "updated_at":"2025-11-21 18:18:28"},
 {"lesson_id":24, "module_id":10, "course_id":5, "title":"Third Conditional", "description":"C\u00e2u \u0111i\u1ec1u ki\u1ec7n lo\u1ea1i 3 m\u00f4 t\u1ea3 gi\u1ea3 \u0111\u1ecbnh trong qu\u00e1 kh\u1ee9 \u2013 \u0111i\u1ec1u kh\u00f4ng x\u1ea3y ra n\u1eefa.", "content":"\ud83d\udd39 C\u1ea5u tr\u00fac: If + Had + V3, Would Have + V3\n\nV\u00ed d\u1ee5:\n\n- If you had left earlier, you would have caught the bus.\n\n- If she had studied harder, she would have passed.\n\n- If they had known the truth, they wouldn\u2019t have made that decision.\n\n\n\u26a0 L\u01b0u \u00fd:\nLo\u1ea1i 3 th\u01b0\u1eddng \u0111i c\u00f9ng c\u1ea3m x\u00fac ti\u1ebfc nu\u1ed1i ho\u1eb7c tr\u00e1ch m\u00f3c.", "video_url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/my-course-videos/The%20third%20conditional%20-%20Grammar-%20Conditionals%20with%20Georgie.mp4", "video_duration":"10:15", "exercise_type":"", "exercise_data":, "exercise_duration":0, "pass_score":0, "max_score":0, "file_attachment":"", "sort_order":4, "lesson_type":"video", "has_exercise":0, "is_free":0, "is_active":1, "view_count":0, "created_at":"2025-11-14 23:00:45", "updated_at":"2025-11-21 18:18:28"},
 {"lesson_id":25, "module_id":10, "course_id":5, "title":"Mixed Conditionals", "description":"K\u1ebft h\u1ee3p lo\u1ea1i 2 v\u00e0 3 \u0111\u1ec3 m\u00f4 t\u1ea3 quan h\u1ec7 gi\u1eefa qu\u00e1 kh\u1ee9 v\u00e0 hi\u1ec7n t\u1ea1i.", "content":"\u2728 Lo\u1ea1i 1: Past \u2192 Present\nIf + Had + V3 \u2192 Would + V\nV\u00ed d\u1ee5:\n- If I had taken the job, I would be living in Japan now.\n\n\n\u2728 Lo\u1ea1i 2: Present \u2192 Past\nIf + Past Simple \u2192 Would Have + V3\nV\u00ed d\u1ee5:\n- If I were more confident, I would have joined the contest.\n\n\n\ud83d\udca1 \u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 d\u1ea1ng n\u00e2ng cao, hay xu\u1ea5t hi\u1ec7n trong b\u00e0i thi B1\u2013C1.", "video_url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/my-course-videos/What%20is%20a%20conditional-%20Grammar-%20Conditionals%20with%20Georgie%20-%20YouTube.mp4", "video_duration":"09:38", "exercise_type":"", "exercise_data":, "exercise_duration":0, "pass_score":0, "max_score":0, "file_attachment":"", "sort_order":5, "lesson_type":"video", "has_exercise":0, "is_free":0, "is_active":1, "view_count":0, "created_at":"2025-11-14 23:00:45", "updated_at":"2025-11-21 18:18:28"},
 {"lesson_id":26, "module_id":11, "course_id":5, "title":"Prepositions of Time", "description":"Gi\u1edbi t\u1eeb ch\u1ec9 th\u1eddi gian: AT \u2013 ON \u2013 IN.", "content":"\ud83d\udd38 AT \u2192 th\u1eddi \u0111i\u1ec3m c\u1ee5 th\u1ec3\nV\u00ed d\u1ee5: at 7 AM, at midnight\n\n\n\ud83d\udd38 ON \u2192 ng\u00e0y, th\u1ee9\nV\u00ed d\u1ee5: on Monday, on July 10th\n\n\n\ud83d\udd38 IN \u2192 th\u00e1ng, n\u0103m, m\u00f9a, bu\u1ed5i\nV\u00ed d\u1ee5: in 2024, in winter, in the afternoon\n\n\n\u2757 L\u1ed7i ph\u1ed5 bi\u1ebfn:\nSai: *I was born on 2001.*\n\u0110\u00fang: *I was born in 2001.*", "video_url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/my-course-videos/Prepositions%20of%20time-%20Prepositions%20with%20Georgie.mp4", "video_duration":"08:20", "exercise_type":"", "exercise_data":, "exercise_duration":0, "pass_score":0, "max_score":0, "file_attachment":"", "sort_order":1, "lesson_type":"video", "has_exercise":0, "is_free":1, "is_active":1, "view_count":0, "created_at":"2025-11-14 23:00:45", "updated_at":"2025-11-21 18:32:41"},
 {"lesson_id":27, "module_id":11, "course_id":5, "title":"Prepositions of Place", "description":"Gi\u1edbi t\u1eeb ch\u1ec9 v\u1ecb tr\u00ed: IN \u2013 ON \u2013 AT \u2013 NEXT TO \u2013 BETWEEN \u2013 BEHIND.", "content":"V\u00ed d\u1ee5:\n\n- The keys are **on** the table.\n\n- She is **in** the kitchen.\n\n- We met **at** the station.\n\n- The school is **next to** the park.\n\n- The cat is **behind** the door.\n\n\n\ud83d\udccc B\u00e0i h\u1ecdc c\u00f3 k\u00e8m h\u00ecnh minh h\u1ecda, gi\u00fap ghi nh\u1edb nhanh.", "video_url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/my-course-videos/Prepositions%20of%20place-%20Prepositions%20with%20Georgie.mp4", "video_duration":"07:55", "exercise_type":"", "exercise_data":, "exercise_duration":0, "pass_score":0, "max_score":0, "file_attachment":"", "sort_order":2, "lesson_type":"video", "has_exercise":0, "is_free":0, "is_active":1, "view_count":0, "created_at":"2025-11-14 23:00:45", "updated_at":"2025-11-21 18:32:41"},
 {"lesson_id":28, "module_id":11, "course_id":5, "title":"Prepositions of Movement", "description":"Gi\u1edbi t\u1eeb ch\u1ec9 chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed9ng: TO \u2013 INTO \u2013 TOWARDS \u2013 THROUGH.", "content":"V\u00ed d\u1ee5:\n\n- She walked **to** school.\n\n- The cat jumped **into** the box.\n\n- He ran **towards** the finish line.\n\n- We walked **through** the forest.\n\n\n\ud83d\udd25 L\u01b0u \u00fd: *to* ch\u1ec9 h\u01b0\u1edbng, *into* ch\u1ec9 chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed9ng t\u1eeb ngo\u00e0i v\u00e0o trong.", "video_url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/my-course-videos/Prepositions%20of%20movement-%20Prepositions%20with%20Georgie.mp4", "video_duration":"08:05", "exercise_type":"", "exercise_data":, "exercise_duration":0, "pass_score":0, "max_score":0, "file_attachment":"", "sort_order":3, "lesson_type":"video", "has_exercise":0, "is_free":0, "is_active":1, "view_count":0, "created_at":"2025-11-14 23:00:45", "updated_at":"2025-11-21 18:32:41"},
 {"lesson_id":29, "module_id":11, "course_id":5, "title":"Prepositions in Daily English", "description":"T\u1ed5ng h\u1ee3p l\u1ed7i gi\u1edbi t\u1eeb th\u01b0\u1eddng g\u1eb7p trong ti\u1ebfng Anh giao ti\u1ebfp.", "content":"V\u00ed d\u1ee5:\n\n- Interested **in** (kh\u00f4ng ph\u1ea3i \u201cinterested on\u201d)\n\n- Good **at** something\n\n- Married **to** someone\n\n- Depend **on** someone\n\n\n\ud83c\udfa4 H\u1ed9i tho\u1ea1i m\u1eabu:\nA: Are you good at cooking?\nB: I\u2019m good at frying eggs only \ud83d\ude06", "video_url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/my-course-videos/Prepositions%20for%20transport-%20Prepositions%20with%20Georgie%20-%20YouTube.mp4", "video_duration":"09:10", "exercise_type":"", "exercise_data":, "exercise_duration":0, "pass_score":0, "max_score":0, "file_attachment":"", "sort_order":4, "lesson_type":"video", "has_exercise":0, "is_free":0, "is_active":1, "view_count":0, "created_at":"2025-11-14 23:00:45", "updated_at":"2025-11-21 18:32:41"},
 {"lesson_id":30, "module_id":11, "course_id":5, "title":"Advanced Prepositions", "description":"Gi\u1edbi t\u1eeb n\u00e2ng cao trong c\u1ea5u tr\u00fac h\u1ecdc thu\u1eadt v\u00e0 idioms.", "content":"V\u00ed d\u1ee5 n\u00e2ng cao:\n\n- By means of = b\u1eb1ng c\u00e1ch\n- In terms of = x\u00e9t v\u1ec1 ph\u01b0\u01a1ng di\u1ec7n\n- With regard to = v\u1ec1 vi\u1ec7c\n- In spite of = m\u1eb7c d\u00f9\n\n\nIdioms:\n- **By accident** = v\u00f4 t\u00ecnh\n- **In charge of** = ch\u1ecbu tr\u00e1ch nhi\u1ec7m\n- **At risk** = g\u1eb7p nguy hi\u1ec3m", "video_url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/my-course-videos/What%20is%20a%20preposition-%20Prepositions%20with%20Georgie.mp4", "video_duration":"08:30", "exercise_type":"", "exercise_data":, "exercise_duration":0, "pass_score":0, "max_score":0, "file_attachment":"", "sort_order":5, "lesson_type":"video", "has_exercise":0, "is_free":0, "is_active":1, "view_count":0, "created_at":"2025-11-14 23:00:45", "updated_at":"2025-11-21 18:32:41"},
 {"lesson_id":31, "module_id":1, "course_id":1, "title":"Beginner English Introduction", "description":"Gi\u1edbi thi\u1ec7u n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng ti\u1ebfng Anh cho ng\u01b0\u1eddi m\u1edbi b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u.", "content":"B\u00e0i h\u1ecdc cung c\u1ea5p n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng c\u01a1 b\u1ea3n nh\u1ea5t cho ng\u01b0\u1eddi m\u1edbi b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u h\u1ecdc ti\u1ebfng Anh, bao g\u1ed3m c\u00e1ch ph\u00e1t \u00e2m, b\u1ea3ng ch\u1eef c\u00e1i v\u00e0 nh\u1eefng c\u1ea5u tr\u00fac \u0111\u01a1n gi\u1ea3n.", "video_url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/my-course-videos/English%20Course%20-%20Beginner%201/Beginner%20English%20Introduction.mp4", "video_duration":"05:00", "exercise_type":"", "exercise_data":, "exercise_duration":0, "pass_score":0, "max_score":0, "file_attachment":"", "sort_order":1, "lesson_type":"video", "has_exercise":0, "is_free":1, "is_active":1, "view_count":0, "created_at":"2025-11-22 02:59:08", "updated_at":"2025-11-22 03:27:11"},
 {"lesson_id":32, "module_id":1, "course_id":1, "title":"English Consonants + Vowels", "description":"H\u1ecdc nguy\u00ean \u00e2m v\u00e0 ph\u1ee5 \u00e2m trong ti\u1ebfng Anh.", "content":"B\u00e0i h\u1ecdc gi\u00fap h\u1ecdc vi\u00ean hi\u1ec3u c\u00e1ch ph\u00e1t \u00e2m to\u00e0n b\u1ed9 nguy\u00ean \u00e2m v\u00e0 ph\u1ee5 \u00e2m trong ti\u1ebfng Anh, k\u00e8m v\u00ed d\u1ee5 v\u00e0 h\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn mi\u1ec7ng.", "video_url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/my-course-videos/English%20Course%20-%20Beginner%201/English%20Consonants%20%2B%20Vowels.mp4", "video_duration":"10:00", "exercise_type":"", "exercise_data":, "exercise_duration":0, "pass_score":0, "max_score":0, "file_attachment":"", "sort_order":2, "lesson_type":"video", "has_exercise":0, "is_free":1, "is_active":1, "view_count":0, "created_at":"2025-11-22 02:59:54", "updated_at":"2025-11-22 03:27:11"},
 {"lesson_id":33, "module_id":1, "course_id":1, "title":"English Grammar: Be Verb & Pronouns", "description":"Gi\u1edbi thi\u1ec7u \u0111\u1ed9ng t\u1eeb Be v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ea1i t\u1eeb nh\u00e2n x\u01b0ng.", "content":"B\u00e0i h\u1ecdc gi\u1ea3i th\u00edch chi ti\u1ebft c\u00e1ch d\u00f9ng \u0111\u1ed9ng t\u1eeb BE (am, is, are) v\u1edbi \u0111\u1ea1i t\u1eeb nh\u00e2n x\u01b0ng trong c\u00e1c t\u00ecnh hu\u1ed1ng th\u1ef1c t\u1ebf.", "video_url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/my-course-videos/English%20Course%20-%20Beginner%201/English%20Grammar%20Be%20Verb%20Pronoun%20Questions.mp4", "video_duration":"12:00", "exercise_type":"", "exercise_data":, "exercise_duration":0, "pass_score":0, "max_score":0, "file_attachment":"", "sort_order":3, "lesson_type":"video", "has_exercise":0, "is_free":1, "is_active":1, "view_count":0, "created_at":"2025-11-22 02:59:55", "updated_at":"2025-11-22 03:27:11"},
 {"lesson_id":34, "module_id":1, "course_id":1, "title":"Grammar Review #1: Subjects", "description":"\u00d4n t\u1eadp ch\u1ee7 ng\u1eef trong c\u00e2u ti\u1ebfng Anh.", "content":"B\u00e0i h\u1ecdc gi\u00fap h\u1ecdc vi\u00ean ph\u00e2n bi\u1ec7t c\u00e1c lo\u1ea1i ch\u1ee7 ng\u1eef, c\u00e1ch x\u00e1c \u0111\u1ecbnh ch\u1ee7 ng\u1eef trong c\u00e2u v\u00e0 l\u1ed7i sai ph\u1ed5 bi\u1ebfn.", "video_url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/my-course-videos/English%20Course%20-%20Beginner%201/English%20Grammar%20Review%20%231%20-%20Subjective%20Pronouns.mp4", "video_duration":"06:00", "exercise_type":"", "exercise_data":, "exercise_duration":0, "pass_score":0, "max_score":0, "file_attachment":"", "sort_order":4, "lesson_type":"video", "has_exercise":0, "is_free":1, "is_active":1, "view_count":0, "created_at":"2025-11-22 02:59:55", "updated_at":"2025-11-22 03:27:11"},
 {"lesson_id":35, "module_id":1, "course_id":1, "title":"English Grammar: Singular & Plural", "description":"H\u1ecdc danh t\u1eeb s\u1ed1 \u00edt v\u00e0 s\u1ed1 nhi\u1ec1u.", "content":"B\u00e0i h\u1ecdc tr\u00ecnh b\u00e0y quy t\u1eafc th\u00eam s/es, danh t\u1eeb b\u1ea5t quy t\u1eafc v\u00e0 c\u00e1c l\u1ed7i th\u01b0\u1eddng g\u1eb7p khi chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed5i gi\u1eefa s\u1ed1 \u00edt v\u00e0 s\u1ed1 nhi\u1ec1u.", "video_url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/my-course-videos/English%20Course%20-%20Beginner%201/English%20Grammar%20Singular%20%2B%20Plural%20Nouns.mp4", "video_duration":"11:00", "exercise_type":"", "exercise_data":, "exercise_duration":0, "pass_score":0, "max_score":0, "file_attachment":"", "sort_order":5, "lesson_type":"video", "has_exercise":0, "is_free":1, "is_active":1, "view_count":0, "created_at":"2025-11-22 02:59:55", "updated_at":"2025-11-22 03:27:11"},
