 {"lesson_id":37, "module_id":1, "course_id":1, "title":"Subjective Pronouns \u2013 Part 2", "description":"Luy\u1ec7n t\u1eadp \u0111\u1ea1i t\u1eeb nh\u00e2n x\u01b0ng d\u1ea1ng m\u1edf r\u1ed9ng.", "content":"B\u00e0i h\u1ecdc ti\u1ebfp t\u1ee5c m\u1edf r\u1ed9ng kh\u00e1i ni\u1ec7m \u0111\u1ea1i t\u1eeb ch\u1ee7 ng\u1eef v\u1edbi nhi\u1ec1u v\u00ed d\u1ee5 th\u1ef1c t\u1ebf v\u00e0 b\u00e0i t\u1eadp.", "video_url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/my-course-videos/English%20Course%20-%20Beginner%201/English%20Grammar%20Subjective%20Pronouns%20%2B%20Be%20%2B%20Not.mp4", "video_duration":"07:00", "exercise_type":"", "exercise_data":, "exercise_duration":0, "pass_score":0, "max_score":0, "file_attachment":"", "sort_order":7, "lesson_type":"video", "has_exercise":0, "is_free":1, "is_active":1, "view_count":0, "created_at":"2025-11-22 02:59:55", "updated_at":"2025-11-22 03:27:11"},
