 {"lesson_id":46, "module_id":3, "course_id":1, "title":"Practice Your English Pronunciation: /\u026a/ vs /i\u02d0/ (sit vs seat)", "description":"Ph\u00e2n bi\u1ec7t hai nguy\u00ean \u00e2m /\u026a/ v\u00e0 /i\u02d0/ qua c\u1eb7p t\u1eeb sit \u2013 seat.", "content":"Trong b\u00e0i h\u1ecdc n\u00e0y, h\u1ecdc vi\u00ean s\u1ebd luy\u1ec7n c\u00e1ch ph\u00e1t \u00e2m hai nguy\u00ean \u00e2m /\u026a/ v\u00e0 /i\u02d0/. B\u00e0i h\u1ecdc gi\u1ea3i th\u00edch chi ti\u1ebft s\u1ef1 kh\u00e1c bi\u1ec7t v\u1ec1 kh\u1ea9u h\u00ecnh, \u0111\u1ed9 m\u1edf mi\u1ec7ng, \u0111\u1ed9 d\u00e0i \u00e2m v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed9 c\u0103ng c\u01a1. H\u1ecdc vi\u00ean s\u1ebd th\u1ef1c h\u00e0nh qua v\u00ed d\u1ee5, b\u00e0i luy\u1ec7n nghe - nh\u1eafc l\u1ea1i v\u00e0 ph\u1ea7n s\u1eeda l\u1ed7i ph\u00e1t \u00e2m th\u01b0\u1eddng g\u1eb7p.", "video_url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/my-course-videos/Coure1%20-%20Module2/module3/Practice%20Your%20English%20Pronunciation%20-e-%20vs%20-e%C9%AA-%20Vowel%20Sounds%20-%20Course%20%233.mp4", "video_duration":"12:27", "exercise_type":"", "exercise_data":, "exercise_duration":0, "pass_score":0, "max_score":0, "file_attachment":"", "sort_order":1, "lesson_type":"video", "has_exercise":0, "is_free":1, "is_active":1, "view_count":0, "created_at":"2025-11-22 03:57:25", "updated_at":"2025-11-22 04:03:05"},
 {"lesson_id":47, "module_id":3, "course_id":1, "title":"Practice Your English Pronunciation: /\u026a/ vs /e/ (bid vs bed)", "description":"H\u1ecdc c\u00e1ch ph\u00e2n bi\u1ec7t hai nguy\u00ean \u00e2m /\u026a/ v\u00e0 /e/ qua c\u1eb7p t\u1eeb bid \u2013 bed.", "content":"B\u00e0i h\u1ecdc t\u1eadp trung v\u00e0o s\u1ef1 kh\u00e1c bi\u1ec7t gi\u1eefa \u00e2m /\u026a/ ng\u1eafn v\u00e0 \u00e2m /e/ trung. Ng\u01b0\u1eddi h\u1ecdc s\u1ebd \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c h\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn v\u1ecb tr\u00ed l\u01b0\u1ee1i, kh\u1ea9u h\u00ecnh v\u00e0 c\u00e1ch \u00e1p d\u1ee5ng v\u00e0o t\u1eeb v\u1ef1ng th\u00f4ng d\u1ee5ng. Video k\u00e8m c\u00e1c b\u00e0i luy\u1ec7n ph\u00e1t \u00e2m v\u00e0 v\u00ed d\u1ee5 chi ti\u1ebft.", "video_url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/my-course-videos/Coure1%20-%20Module2/module3/Practice%20Your%20English%20Pronunciation%20-%C3%A6-%20vs%20-%CA%8C-%20Vowel%20Sounds%20-%20Course%20%234%20-%20YouTube.mp4", "video_duration":"10:04", "exercise_type":"", "exercise_data":, "exercise_duration":0, "pass_score":0, "max_score":0, "file_attachment":"", "sort_order":2, "lesson_type":"video", "has_exercise":0, "is_free":1, "is_active":1, "view_count":0, "created_at":"2025-11-22 03:57:25", "updated_at":"2025-11-22 04:03:05"},
 {"lesson_id":48, "module_id":3, "course_id":1, "title":"Practice Your English Pronunciation: /e/ vs /e\u026a/ (let vs late)", "description":"Ph\u00e2n bi\u1ec7t \u00e2m /e/ v\u00e0 \u00e2m \u0111\u00f4i /e\u026a/ qua c\u1eb7p t\u1eeb let \u2013 late.", "content":"B\u00e0i h\u1ecdc gi\u1ea3i th\u00edch s\u1ef1 kh\u00e1c bi\u1ec7t gi\u1eefa \u00e2m \u0111\u01a1n /e/ v\u00e0 \u00e2m \u0111\u00f4i /e\u026a/, c\u00e1ch k\u00e9o \u00e2m v\u00e0 chuy\u1ec3n kh\u1ea9u h\u00ecnh. Ng\u01b0\u1eddi h\u1ecdc \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c luy\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ecdc c\u00e1c t\u1eeb m\u1eabu, c\u00e2u m\u1eabu v\u00e0 ph\u1ea7n th\u1ef1c h\u00e0nh luy\u1ec7n nghe \u2013 l\u1eb7p l\u1ea1i gi\u00fap ghi nh\u1edb l\u00e2u h\u01a1n.", "video_url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/my-course-videos/Coure1%20-%20Module2/module3/Practice%20Your%20English%20Pronunciation%20-%C9%99%CA%8A-%20vs%20-%C9%94%CB%90-%20Vowel%20Sounds%20-%20Course%20%235%20-%20YouTube.mp4", "video_duration":"12:14", "exercise_type":"", "exercise_data":, "exercise_duration":0, "pass_score":0, "max_score":0, "file_attachment":"", "sort_order":3, "lesson_type":"video", "has_exercise":0, "is_free":1, "is_active":1, "view_count":0, "created_at":"2025-11-22 03:57:25", "updated_at":"2025-11-22 04:03:05"},
 {"lesson_id":49, "module_id":3, "course_id":1, "title":"Practice Your English Pronunciation: /\u00e6/ vs /\u028c/ (ran vs run)", "description":"Luy\u1ec7n ph\u00e2n bi\u1ec7t \u00e2m /\u00e6/ v\u00e0 \u00e2m /\u028c/ qua c\u1eb7p t\u1eeb ran \u2013 run.", "content":"B\u00e0i h\u1ecdc h\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn c\u00e1ch m\u1edf mi\u1ec7ng v\u00e0 \u0111i\u1ec1u ch\u1ec9nh kh\u1ea9u h\u00ecnh \u0111\u1ec3 ph\u00e1t \u00e2m \u00e2m /\u00e6/ chu\u1ea9n, c\u00f9ng v\u1edbi c\u00e1ch ph\u00e1t \u00e2m \u00e2m trung /\u028c/ ph\u1ed5 bi\u1ebfn trong nhi\u1ec1u t\u1eeb ti\u1ebfng Anh. Bao g\u1ed3m b\u00e0i t\u1eadp \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng v\u00e0 s\u1eeda l\u1ed7i ph\u00e1t \u00e2m th\u01b0\u1eddng g\u1eb7p c\u1ee7a ng\u01b0\u1eddi Vi\u1ec7t.", "video_url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/my-course-videos/Coure1%20-%20Module2/module3/Practice%20Your%20English%20Pronunciation-%20-e-%20vs%20-%C9%AA-%20Vowel%20Sounds%20-%20Course%20%232%20-%20YouTube.mp4", "video_duration":"13:33", "exercise_type":"", "exercise_data":, "exercise_duration":0, "pass_score":0, "max_score":0, "file_attachment":"", "sort_order":4, "lesson_type":"video", "has_exercise":0, "is_free":1, "is_active":1, "view_count":0, "created_at":"2025-11-22 03:57:25", "updated_at":"2025-11-22 04:03:05"},
 {"lesson_id":50, "module_id":3, "course_id":1, "title":"Practice Your English Pronunciation: /\u0259\u028a/ vs /\u0254\u02d0/ (so vs saw)", "description":"Luy\u1ec7n ph\u00e2n bi\u1ec7t \u00e2m \u0111\u00f4i /\u0259\u028a/ v\u00e0 \u00e2m d\u00e0i /\u0254\u02d0/ qua c\u1eb7p t\u1eeb so \u2013 saw.", "content":"B\u00e0i h\u1ecdc m\u00f4 t\u1ea3 s\u1ef1 kh\u00e1c bi\u1ec7t r\u00f5 r\u00e0ng gi\u1eefa \u00e2m /\u0259\u028a/ v\u00e0 \u00e2m /\u0254\u02d0/, c\u00e1ch k\u00e9o \u00e2m, chuy\u1ec3n kh\u1ea9u h\u00ecnh v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ecdc t\u1eeb v\u00ed d\u1ee5. Cu\u1ed1i b\u00e0i c\u00f3 ph\u1ea7n ki\u1ec3m tra nhanh \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111\u00e1nh gi\u00e1 kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng ghi nh\u1edb c\u1ee7a h\u1ecdc vi\u00ean.", "video_url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/my-course-videos/Coure1%20-%20Module2/module3/Practice%20Your%20English%20Pronunciation-%20-%C9%AA-%20vs%20-i%CB%90-%20Vowel%20Sounds%20-%20Course%20%231%20-%20YouTube.mp4", "video_duration":"12:19", "exercise_type":"", "exercise_data":, "exercise_duration":0, "pass_score":0, "max_score":0, "file_attachment":"", "sort_order":5, "lesson_type":"video", "has_exercise":0, "is_free":1, "is_active":1, "view_count":0, "created_at":"2025-11-22 03:57:25", "updated_at":"2025-11-22 04:03:05"},
 {"lesson_id":51, "module_id":4, "course_id":1, "title":"How Much Soju Can You Drink?", "description":"B\u00e0i h\u1ed9i tho\u1ea1i luy\u1ec7n n\u00f3i v\u1ec1 c\u00e1ch h\u1ecfi \u2013 tr\u1ea3 l\u1eddi l\u01b0\u1ee3ng \u0111\u1ed3 u\u1ed1ng c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 u\u1ed1ng.", "content":"B\u00e0i h\u1ecdc gi\u00fap ng\u01b0\u1eddi h\u1ecdc luy\u1ec7n t\u1eeb v\u1ef1ng v\u1ec1 \u0111\u1ed3 u\u1ed1ng, c\u00e1ch h\u1ecfi kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng ch\u1ecbu \u0111\u1ef1ng r\u01b0\u1ee3u trong ti\u1ebfng Anh, v\u00e0 luy\u1ec7n ph\u1ea3n x\u1ea1 giao ti\u1ebfp t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean qua v\u00ed d\u1ee5 th\u1ef1c t\u1ebf.", "video_url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/my-course-videos/Coure1%20-%20Module2/module4/How%20Much%20Soju%20Can%20you%20Drink-%20-%20YouTube.mp4", "video_duration":"3:58", "exercise_type":"", "exercise_data":, "exercise_duration":0, "pass_score":0, "max_score":0, "file_attachment":"", "sort_order":1, "lesson_type":"video", "has_exercise":0, "is_free":1, "is_active":1, "view_count":0, "created_at":"2025-11-22 04:00:40", "updated_at":"2025-11-22 04:03:05"},
 {"lesson_id":52, "module_id":4, "course_id":1, "title":"What\u2019s Your Religion?", "description":"H\u1ecdc c\u00e1ch h\u1ecfi v\u00e0 n\u00f3i v\u1ec1 t\u00f4n gi\u00e1o trong giao ti\u1ebfp ti\u1ebfng Anh.", "content":"B\u00e0i h\u1ecdc cung c\u1ea5p m\u1eabu c\u00e2u l\u1ecbch s\u1ef1 \u0111\u1ec3 h\u1ecfi v\u1ec1 t\u00f4n gi\u00e1o, c\u00e1ch th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n quan \u0111i\u1ec3m c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n, v\u00e0 nh\u1eefng l\u01b0u \u00fd v\u0103n h\u00f3a khi giao ti\u1ebfp v\u1edbi ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u1ea3n x\u1ee9.", "video_url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/my-course-videos/Coure1%20-%20Module2/module4/What's%20Your%20Religion-%20-%20YouTube.mp4", "video_duration":"4:07", "exercise_type":"", "exercise_data":, "exercise_duration":0, "pass_score":0, "max_score":0, "file_attachment":"", "sort_order":2, "lesson_type":"video", "has_exercise":0, "is_free":1, "is_active":1, "view_count":0, "created_at":"2025-11-22 04:00:40", "updated_at":"2025-11-22 04:03:05"},
 {"lesson_id":53, "module_id":4, "course_id":1, "title":"Describing Cost / Price in English", "description":"Luy\u1ec7n c\u00e1ch m\u00f4 t\u1ea3 gi\u00e1 c\u1ea3 v\u00e0 chi ph\u00ed b\u1eb1ng ti\u1ebfng Anh.", "content":"B\u00e0i h\u1ecdc h\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn c\u00e1ch n\u00f3i gi\u00e1, m\u00f4 t\u1ea3 m\u1ee9c gi\u00e1 \u0111\u1eaft/r\u1ebb, di\u1ec5n \u0111\u1ea1t gi\u1ea3m gi\u00e1, v\u00e0 d\u00f9ng c\u00e1c m\u1eabu c\u00e2u th\u00f4ng d\u1ee5ng trong t\u00ecnh hu\u1ed1ng mua s\u1eafm th\u1ef1c t\u1ebf.", "video_url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/my-course-videos/Coure1%20-%20Module2/module4/Describing%20Cost%20-%20Price%20in%20English%20-%20YouTube.mp4", "video_duration":"4:22", "exercise_type":"", "exercise_data":, "exercise_duration":0, "pass_score":0, "max_score":0, "file_attachment":"", "sort_order":3, "lesson_type":"video", "has_exercise":0, "is_free":1, "is_active":1, "view_count":0, "created_at":"2025-11-22 04:00:40", "updated_at":"2025-11-22 04:03:05"},
 {"lesson_id":54, "module_id":4, "course_id":1, "title":"Asking About Vacation in English", "description":"Luy\u1ec7n k\u1ef9 n\u0103ng h\u1ecfi v\u00e0 tr\u1ea3 l\u1eddi v\u1ec1 k\u1ef3 ngh\u1ec9 trong ti\u1ebfng Anh.", "content":"B\u00e0i h\u1ecdc gi\u00fap ng\u01b0\u1eddi h\u1ecdc luy\u1ec7n m\u1eabu c\u00e2u n\u00f3i v\u1ec1 k\u1ebf ho\u1ea1ch du l\u1ecbch, tr\u1ea3i nghi\u1ec7m k\u1ef3 ngh\u1ec9, v\u00e0 tr\u00f2 chuy\u1ec7n t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean v\u1ec1 c\u00e1c ch\u1ee7 \u0111\u1ec1 quen thu\u1ed9c.", "video_url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/my-course-videos/Coure1%20-%20Module2/module4/Asking%20About%20Vacation%20in%20English.mp4", "video_duration":"5:25", "exercise_type":"", "exercise_data":, "exercise_duration":0, "pass_score":0, "max_score":0, "file_attachment":"", "sort_order":4, "lesson_type":"video", "has_exercise":0, "is_free":1, "is_active":1, "view_count":0, "created_at":"2025-11-22 04:00:40", "updated_at":"2025-11-22 04:03:05"},
 {"lesson_id":55, "module_id":4, "course_id":1, "title":"Asking About Country in English", "description":"H\u1ecdc c\u00e1ch h\u1ecfi v\u00e0 n\u00f3i v\u1ec1 qu\u1ed1c gia, n\u01a1i sinh s\u1ed1ng v\u00e0 v\u0103n h\u00f3a.", "content":"B\u00e0i h\u1ecdc cung c\u1ea5p m\u1eabu c\u00e2u h\u1ecfi v\u1ec1 qu\u00ea qu\u00e1n, qu\u1ed1c t\u1ecbch, v\u00e0 \u0111\u1eb7c \u0111i\u1ec3m v\u0103n h\u00f3a. C\u00f3 th\u00eam ph\u1ea7n luy\u1ec7n h\u1ed9i tho\u1ea1i \u0111\u1ec3 ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n s\u1ef1 t\u1ef1 tin khi giao ti\u1ebfp.", "video_url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/my-course-videos/Coure1%20-%20Module2/module4/Asking%20About%20Country%20in%20English%20-%20YouTube.mp4", "video_duration":"5:34", "exercise_type":"", "exercise_data":, "exercise_duration":0, "pass_score":0, "max_score":0, "file_attachment":"", "sort_order":5, "lesson_type":"video", "has_exercise":0, "is_free":1, "is_active":1, "view_count":0, "created_at":"2025-11-22 04:00:40", "updated_at":"2025-11-22 04:03:05"},
 {"lesson_id":56, "module_id":4, "course_id":1, "title":"Rude English Marriage Questions", "description":"H\u1ecdc c\u00e1ch nh\u1eadn bi\u1ebft v\u00e0 ph\u1ea3n h\u1ed3i nh\u1eefng c\u00e2u h\u1ecfi nh\u1ea1y c\u1ea3m v\u1ec1 h\u00f4n nh\u00e2n.", "content":"B\u00e0i h\u1ecdc gi\u00fap ng\u01b0\u1eddi h\u1ecdc hi\u1ec3u c\u00e1c c\u00e2u h\u1ecfi v\u1ec1 h\u00f4n nh\u00e2n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c xem l\u00e0 thi\u1ebfu l\u1ecbch s\u1ef1, c\u00e1ch tr\u1ea3 l\u1eddi kh\u00e9o l\u00e9o v\u00e0 m\u1eabu c\u00e2u giao ti\u1ebfp mang t\u00ednh l\u1ecbch s\u1ef1 trong ti\u1ebfng Anh.", "video_url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/my-course-videos/Coure1%20-%20Module2/module4/Rude%20English%20Marriage%20Questions%20-%20YouTube.mp4", "video_duration":"1:53", "exercise_type":"", "exercise_data":, "exercise_duration":0, "pass_score":0, "max_score":0, "file_attachment":"", "sort_order":6, "lesson_type":"video", "has_exercise":0, "is_free":1, "is_active":1, "view_count":0, "created_at":"2025-11-22 04:00:40", "updated_at":"2025-11-22 04:03:05"},
 {"lesson_id":57, "module_id":8, "course_id":3, "title":"Common English Mistakes #1: Hard vs Hardly", "description":"Gi\u1ea3i th\u00edch s\u1ef1 kh\u00e1c nhau gi\u1eefa \"hard\" v\u00e0 \"hardly\" trong ti\u1ebfng Anh.", "content":"B\u00e0i h\u1ecdc gi\u00fap h\u1ecdc vi\u00ean hi\u1ec3u r\u00f5 c\u00e1ch d\u00f9ng \"hard\" (ch\u0103m ch\u1ec9 / kh\u00f3 kh\u0103n) v\u00e0 \"hardly\" (h\u1ea7u nh\u01b0 kh\u00f4ng). B\u00e0i gi\u1ea3ng c\u00f3 v\u00ed d\u1ee5 th\u1ef1c t\u1ebf, b\u00e0i t\u1eadp ph\u00e2n bi\u1ec7t v\u00e0 c\u00e1c c\u00e2u luy\u1ec7n t\u1eadp ghi nh\u1edb.", "video_url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/my-course-videos/Common%20Mistake/Common%20English%20Mistakes%20%231-%20Hard%20vs%20Hardly%20Adverb%20Confusion.mp4", "video_duration":"4:04", "exercise_type":"", "exercise_data":, "exercise_duration":0, "pass_score":0, "max_score":0, "file_attachment":"", "sort_order":1, "lesson_type":"video", "has_exercise":0, "is_free":1, "is_active":1, "view_count":0, "created_at":"2025-11-22 04:22:35", "updated_at":"2025-11-22 04:25:17"},
 {"lesson_id":58, "module_id":8, "course_id":3, "title":"Common English Mistakes: Comparatives and Superlatives", "description":"C\u00e1ch d\u00f9ng t\u00ednh t\u1eeb so s\u00e1nh h\u01a1n v\u00e0 so s\u00e1nh nh\u1ea5t \u0111\u00fang chu\u1ea9n.", "content":"B\u00e0i h\u1ecdc h\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn c\u00e1ch d\u00f9ng comparatives v\u00e0 superlatives, c\u00e1c tr\u01b0\u1eddng h\u1ee3p b\u1ea5t quy t\u1eafc, l\u1ed7i th\u01b0\u1eddng g\u1eb7p, c\u00f9ng b\u00e0i luy\u1ec7n th\u1ef1c h\u00e0nh theo v\u00ed d\u1ee5.", "video_url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/my-course-videos/Common%20Mistake/Common%20English%20Mistakes%20-%20Comparatives%20and%20Superlatives.mp4", "video_duration":"3:36", "exercise_type":"", "exercise_data":, "exercise_duration":0, "pass_score":0, "max_score":0, "file_attachment":"", "sort_order":2, "lesson_type":"video", "has_exercise":0, "is_free":1, "is_active":1, "view_count":0, "created_at":"2025-11-22 04:22:35", "updated_at":"2025-11-22 04:25:17"},
 {"lesson_id":59, "module_id":8, "course_id":3, "title":"Then vs Than | Common English Mistakes", "description":"Ph\u00e2n bi\u1ec7t then v\u00e0 than \u2013 hai t\u1eeb g\u00e2y nh\u1ea7m l\u1eabn ph\u1ed5 bi\u1ebfn.", "content":"H\u1ecdc vi\u00ean \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c h\u1ecdc c\u00e1ch d\u00f9ng \"then\" (th\u1eddi gian / k\u1ebft qu\u1ea3) v\u00e0 \"than\" (so s\u00e1nh). K\u00e8m theo b\u00e0i t\u1eadp ch\u1ecdn \u0111\u00e1p \u00e1n v\u00e0 ph\u00e2n t\u00edch l\u1ed7i.", "video_url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/my-course-videos/Common%20Mistake/Then%20vs%20Than%20-%20Common%20English%20Mistakes%20-%20YouTube.mp4", "video_duration":"4:22", "exercise_type":"", "exercise_data":, "exercise_duration":0, "pass_score":0, "max_score":0, "file_attachment":"", "sort_order":3, "lesson_type":"video", "has_exercise":0, "is_free":1, "is_active":1, "view_count":0, "created_at":"2025-11-22 04:22:35", "updated_at":"2025-11-22 04:25:17"},
 {"lesson_id":60, "module_id":8, "course_id":3, "title":"You're vs Your | Common English Mistakes", "description":"Ph\u00e2n bi\u1ec7t Your v\u00e0 You\u2019re \u2013 l\u1ed7i ng\u1eef ph\u00e1p r\u1ea5t hay g\u1eb7p.", "content":"B\u00e0i h\u1ecdc gi\u1ea3i th\u00edch r\u00f5 c\u1ea5u tr\u00fac c\u1ee7a \"you are\" \u2192 \"you're\" v\u00e0 s\u1edf h\u1eefu t\u1eeb \"your\". \u0110i k\u00e8m v\u00ed d\u1ee5 d\u1ec5 hi\u1ec3u v\u00e0 b\u00e0i luy\u1ec7n vi\u1ebft c\u00e2u \u0111\u00fang \u2013 sai.", "video_url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/my-course-videos/Common%20Mistake/You're%20vs%20Your%20-%20Common%20English%20Mistakes.mp4", "video_duration":"4:05", "exercise_type":"", "exercise_data":, "exercise_duration":0, "pass_score":0, "max_score":0, "file_attachment":"", "sort_order":4, "lesson_type":"video", "has_exercise":0, "is_free":1, "is_active":1, "view_count":0, "created_at":"2025-11-22 04:22:35", "updated_at":"2025-11-22 04:25:17"},
 {"lesson_id":61, "module_id":8, "course_id":3, "title":"Good vs Well | Common English Grammar Mistakes", "description":"Ph\u00e2n bi\u1ec7t Good v\u00e0 Well trong c\u00e1c t\u00ecnh hu\u1ed1ng giao ti\u1ebfp.", "content":"B\u00e0i h\u1ecdc gi\u00fap ng\u01b0\u1eddi h\u1ecdc nh\u1eadn bi\u1ebft \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c khi n\u00e0o d\u00f9ng \"good\" (t\u00ednh t\u1eeb) v\u00e0 \"well\" (tr\u1ea1ng t\u1eeb), c\u00f9ng v\u1edbi c\u00e1c c\u1ea5u tr\u00fac ngo\u1ea1i l\u1ec7 th\u01b0\u1eddng g\u1eb7p.", "video_url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/my-course-videos/Common%20Mistake/Good%20vs%20Well%20-%20Common%20English%20Grammar%20Mistakes%20-%20YouTube.mp4", "video_duration":"4:46", "exercise_type":"", "exercise_data":, "exercise_duration":0, "pass_score":0, "max_score":0, "file_attachment":"", "sort_order":5, "lesson_type":"video", "has_exercise":0, "is_free":1, "is_active":1, "view_count":0, "created_at":"2025-11-22 04:22:35", "updated_at":"2025-11-22 04:25:17"},
 {"lesson_id":62, "module_id":8, "course_id":3, "title":"Pronunciation Practice \u2013 T\u1ed5ng H\u1ee3p B\u00e0i T\u1eadp", "description":"B\u00e0i t\u1eadp ki\u1ec3m tra kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng ph\u00e2n bi\u1ec7t c\u00e1c c\u1eb7p \u00e2m trong 5 b\u00e0i h\u1ecdc tr\u01b0\u1edbc.", "content":"B\u00e0i t\u1eadp n\u00e0y gi\u00fap h\u1ecdc vi\u00ean \u00f4n l\u1ea1i 5 c\u1eb7p \u00e2m: /\u026a/ vs /i\u02d0/, /\u026a/ vs /e/, /e/ vs /e\u026a/, /\u00e6/ vs /\u028c/ v\u00e0 /\u0259\u028a/ vs /\u0254\u02d0/. M\u1ed7i c\u00e2u h\u1ecfi s\u1ebd y\u00eau c\u1ea7u ch\u1ecdn \u0111\u00e1p \u00e1n \u0111\u00fang d\u1ef1a tr\u00ean ph\u00e1t \u00e2m ho\u1eb7c ng\u1eef ngh\u0129a.", "video_url":"", "video_duration":"", "exercise_type":"multiple_choice", "exercise_data":{"questions": [{"answer": "/iː/", "options": ["/ɪ/", "/iː/"], "question": "Chọn cách phát âm đúng của từ \"seat\"."}, {"answer": "/e/", "options": ["/ɪ/", "/e/"], "question": "Âm trong từ \"bed\" là gì?"}, {"answer": "/eɪ/", "options": ["/e/", "/eɪ/"], "question": "Từ \"late\" chứa âm nào?"}, {"answer": "/ʌ/", "options": ["/æ/", "/ʌ/"], "question": "Từ \"run\" có âm chính là?"}, {"answer": "/ɔː/", "options": ["/əʊ/", "/ɔː/"], "question": "Chọn âm đúng trong từ \"saw\"."}]}, "exercise_duration":15, "pass_score":70, "max_score":100, "file_attachment":"", "sort_order":6, "lesson_type":"quiz", "has_exercise":1, "is_free":1, "is_active":1, "view_count":0, "created_at":"2025-11-22 04:30:37", "updated_at":"2025-11-22 04:42:25"}]